  "sellingType": "By Private Treaty",
  "description": "A superb two bedroom apartment located on the second floor.\n\nA beautifully appointed second floor residence offering light filled interiors and an elevated view.\n\nThis wonderfully bright and well kept two bedroom apartment on the second floor of the Horizon Building in Ashtown, Dublin 15 comes to the market in excellent condition. Apartment 50 is a home that feels instantly comfortable, with a great sense of space and plenty of natural light throughout.\n\nThe layout is clever and practical. An inviting entrance hall leads into a spacious open plan living and dining area, designed for everyday living and entertaining. Large south facing windows draw in the light, and the kitchen is fitted with modern units and generous counter space, making it both stylish and functional. Both bedrooms are a generous size and offer ample wardrobe storage. The bathroom is finished to a high standard with WC, WHB and a shower over bath. \n\nThe Horizon Building itself is well managed, with secure access and tidy communal areas, adding to the overall sense of quality and convenience. Residents enjoy access to two on site gyms open 7 days a week, 6am to 10pm.\n\nAdditional benefits include a secure, designated underground car parking space.\n\nAshtown has become one of Dublin 15's most popular neighbourhoods, due to its friendly village feel and excellent local amenities including a creche, Aldi and a GP practice Shops, cafés, fitness facilities, and scenic canal walks are all within easy reach. Transport links are a real highlight, Broombridge LUAS stop is a 15 minute walk away, Pelletstown Train Station is only a short 2 minute walk away, offering quick and frequent services to the city centre. Several Dublin Bus routes serve the area included the 120 route which stops adjacent to the property, giving reliable connections across the city. For those travelling by car, the N3 and M50 are just minutes away, making commuting simple and straightforward. It's a location that blends convenience, community, and great transport options in equal measure.",
  "features": [
    "Spacious two bedroom apartment.",
    "Elevated south facing views.",
    "5 minute walk from Pelletstown train station.",
    "One secure underground car space.",
    "No rent cap.",
    "Located beside Tolka Valley Park.",
    "24hrs security."
